:::


Lusaka Province was the only province in which all processes had been completed across all CFMGs, while Eastern Province had the highest proportion of incomplete legal processes. Overall, completion of legal processes was quite patchy. Some processes, such as the Recognition letter, CF Agreement, Management Plan and Bylaws & Constitution, seem to have been completed for most CFMGs, but the Registration Certificate, User-rights Permit and Benefit-sharing Agreement were less often completed. This assessment is based on the responses of the CFMG executives, who should be well informed. Nevertheless, it may be that more processes have been completed, especially where the CFMG is being supported by external partners, such as NGOs or carbon trading agencies.

## CFMG governance processes

Through the survey, we asked CFMG executives what governance processes were being implemented, such as holding CFMG elections, issuing permits and annual reporting (@tbl-governance_processes).


::: {#tbl-governance_processes .cell tbl-cap='CFMG governance processes conducted by province'}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true"}
cfmg |> filter(interview_type == "cfmg_executive") |>
        mutate(
               cfmg_elections = case_match(
                       cfmg_governance_cfmg_held_election,
                       "yes" ~ 1,
                       "no" ~ 0,
                       .default = NA_integer_),
               cfmg_term_limits = case_match(
                       cfmg_governance_term_limits_exist,
                       "yes" ~ 1,
                       "no" ~ 0,
                       .default = NA_integer_),
               cfmg_HFO = case_match(
                       cfmg_governance_yn_employ_honorary_forest_officers,
                       "yes" ~ 1,
                       "no" ~ 0,
                       .default = NA_integer_),
               cfmg_receipt_book = case_match(
                       cfmg_governance_receipt_book_maintained,
                       "yes" ~ 1,
                       "no" ~ 0,
                       .default = NA_integer_),
               cfmg_bank_acc = case_match(
                       cfmg_governance_bank_account,
                       "yes" ~ 1,
                       "no" ~ 0,
                       .default = NA_integer_),
               cfmg_financial_rep = case_match(
                       cfmg_governance_financial_reports_to_community,
                       "yes" ~ 1,
                       "no" ~ 0,
                       .default = NA_integer_),
               cfmg_annual_rep = case_match(
                       cfmg_governance_annual_report_to_community,
                       "yes" ~ 1,
                       "no" ~ 0,
                       .default = NA_integer_),
               cfmg_permits = case_match(
                       cfmg_governance_issue_licenses_permits,
                       "yes" ~ 1,
                       "no" ~ 0,
                       .default = NA_integer_)

        ) |>
        group_by(province) |>
        summarise(
                `CFMG elections` = mean(
                        cfmg_elections,
                        na.rm = TRUE),
                `CFMG term-limits` = mean(
                        cfmg_term_limits,
                        na.rm = TRUE),
                `Receipt book` = mean(
                        cfmg_receipt_book,
                        na.rm = TRUE),
                `Bank acc` = mean(
                        cfmg_bank_acc,
                        na.rm = TRUE),
                `Permits issued` = mean(
                        cfmg_permits,
                        na.rm = TRUE),
                `Financial reporting` = mean(
                        cfmg_financial_rep,
                        na.rm = TRUE),
                `Annual reporting` = mean(
                        cfmg_annual_rep,
                        na.rm = TRUE),
                `HFOs appointed` = mean(
                        cfmg_HFO,
                        na.rm = TRUE)
        ) |>
        gt() |>
        fmt_percent(columns = -province, decimals = 0) |>
        tab_header(title = "CFMG governance processes",
                   subtitle = "Values represent the % of CFMGs completing/conducting each governance process by province. n = 75 CFMGs.") |>
        opt_align_table_header(align = "left") |>
        cols_align(align = "center", columns = -province) |>
        cols_align(align = "left", columns = province) |>
        tab_style(
          style     = cell_text(align = "center"),
          locations = cells_column_labels(columns = province)
        ) |>
        sub_missing()
