The table below (@tbl-support_organisations) lists the partners organisations and the number of CFMGs they support. It is important to note that this list does not cover all organisations supporting CFMGs or all the CFMGs that are supported by a named organisation, but only those in our sample of 75 CFMGs. The FD is named as a partner in situations where the district FD office was responsible for setting up the CFMG and other partners are not involved.


::: {#tbl-support_organisations .cell tbl-cap='Organisations partnering with CFMGs'}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true"}
